    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819830/extras/bfcc47533a6f5ffdeb4664b36df6c3f3.avif?t=1755775369\" width=900 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant vegetables, water your crops, and harvest them to earn money and resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use those resources to build machines, defenses, and upgrade your tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive incoming waves of enemies by farming efficiently and defending your chicken at all costs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819830/extras/478dd59467a67b7073e726ab45bd47bd.avif?t=1755775369\" width=900 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819830/extras/2b98cf98f8f7c1da741dc55fd689ccf1.poster.avif?t=1755775369\" width=800 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819830/extras/2b98cf98f8f7c1da741dc55fd689ccf1.webm?t=1755775369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819830/extras/2b98cf98f8f7c1da741dc55fd689ccf1.mp4?t=1755775369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your fields, unlock new seeds, and automate your farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every crop counts when the next wave is coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819830/extras/03ae225115b5d23f091db08d8bc6602b.avif?t=1755775369\" width=900 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819830/extras/b1eb81fda9df1943e7ba37926e7ff348.poster.avif?t=1755775369\" width=800 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819830/extras/b1eb81fda9df1943e7ba37926e7ff348.webm?t=1755775369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819830/extras/b1eb81fda9df1943e7ba37926e7ff348.mp4?t=1755775369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies are coming for everything \u2014 especially your chicken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, fight, survive. Lose the chicken, lose it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819830/extras/319a6ba425c4b9d7146f9f051b858840.avif?t=1755775369\" width=900 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic blend of farming and tower defense</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-paced levels with rising difficulty</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource management and meaningful upgrades</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique enemy types and boss fights</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And most important:</strong> <i><strong>Defend your chicken!</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819830/extras/bfcc47533a6f5ffdeb4664b36df6c3f3.avif?t=1755775369\" width=900 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant vegetables, water your crops, and harvest them to earn money and resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use those resources to build machines, defenses, and upgrade your tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive incoming waves of enemies by farming efficiently and defending your chicken at all costs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819830/extras/478dd59467a67b7073e726ab45bd47bd.avif?t=1755775369\" width=900 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819830/extras/2b98cf98f8f7c1da741dc55fd689ccf1.poster.avif?t=1755775369\" width=800 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819830/extras/2b98cf98f8f7c1da741dc55fd689ccf1.webm?t=1755775369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819830/extras/2b98cf98f8f7c1da741dc55fd689ccf1.mp4?t=1755775369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your fields, unlock new seeds, and automate your farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every crop counts when the next wave is coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819830/extras/03ae225115b5d23f091db08d8bc6602b.avif?t=1755775369\" width=900 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819830/extras/b1eb81fda9df1943e7ba37926e7ff348.poster.avif?t=1755775369\" width=800 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819830/extras/b1eb81fda9df1943e7ba37926e7ff348.webm?t=1755775369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819830/extras/b1eb81fda9df1943e7ba37926e7ff348.mp4?t=1755775369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies are coming for everything \u2014 especially your chicken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, fight, survive. Lose the chicken, lose it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819830/extras/319a6ba425c4b9d7146f9f051b858840.avif?t=1755775369\" width=900 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic blend of farming and tower defense</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-paced levels with rising difficulty</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource management and meaningful upgrades</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique enemy types and boss fights</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And most important:</strong> <i><strong>Defend your chicken!</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
